 the new features and resolved issues throughout all releases.\n\nDownload and description of Gemini 330 series firmware\n\nGet the firmware changelog ：[Firmware changelog](https://orbbec-debian-repos-aws.s3.amazonaws.com/product/Firmware_changelog.pdf)\n\n**Firmware**\n\n**Release**\n\n**Release Date**\n\n**FW Version**\n\n**SDK Version**\n\n**Supported Pruduct**\n\n**Comment**\n\n**Release Method**\n\n[Gemini330\\_Release\\_1.8.17](https://orbbec-debian-repos-aws.s3.amazonaws.com/product/Gemini330_Release_v1.8.17.zip)\n\nRelease\\_1.8.17\n\n05-Aug-26\n\n1.8.17\n\n[2.9.3](https://github.com/orbbec/OrbbecSDK_v2/releases/tag/v2.9.3)\n\nGemini 338Le/338Lg\n\nNew FW release\n\nonline update & production configuration\n\n[Gemini330\\_Release\\_1.8.10](https://orbbec-debian-repos-aws.s3.amazonaws.com/product/Gemini330_Release_1.8.10.zip)\n\nRelease\\_1.8.10\n\n26-Jun-26\n\n1.8.10\n\n[2.8.7](https://github.com/orbbec/OrbbecSDK_v2/releases/tag/v2.8.7)\n\nGemini 335/336/330\n\nGemini 335L/336L/330L\n\nGemini 335Lg\n\nGemini 335Le\n\nNew FW & SDK release\n\nonline update & production configuration\n\n[Gemini330\\_Release\\_1.6.00](https://orbbec-debian-repos-aws.s3.amazonaws.com/product/Gemini330_Release_1.6.00.zip)\n\nRelease\\_1.6.00\n\n13-Oct-25\n\n1.6.00\n\n[2.5.5](https://github.com/orbbec/OrbbecSDK_v2/releases/tag/v2.5.5)\n\nGemini 335/336/330\n\nGemini 335L/336L/330L\n\nGemini 335Lg\n\nGemini 335Le\n\nNew FW & SDK release\n\nonline update & production configuration\n\n[Gemini330\\_Release\\_1.5.55](https://orbbec-debian-repos-aws.s3.amazonaws.com/product/Gemini330_Release_1.5.55.zip)\n\nRelease\\_1.5.55\n\n30-Jun-25\n\n1.5.55\n\n[2.4.3](https://github.com/orbbec/OrbbecSDK_v2/releases/tag/v2.4.3)\n\nGemini 335/336/330\n\nGemini 335L/336L/330L\n\nGemini 335Lg\n\nGemini 335Le\n\nNew FW & SDK release\n\nonline update\n\n[Gemini330\\_Release\\_1.5.31](https://orbbec-debian-repos-aws.s3.amazonaws.com/product/Gemini330_Release_1.5.31.zip)\n\nRelease\\_1.5.31\n\n15-Apr-25\n\n