development and production. The version numbering scheme is as follows:\n\nFirmware Naming Convention: Product\\_Name\\_VersionNumber  \nThe version number follows the format \"Release\\_X.Y.ZZ\".\n\n*   The increment of the digit X represents a major version update, which is a version that has undergone comprehensive testing.\n*   The increment of the digit Y.ZZ represents a version that has undergone incremental and regression testing.\n\nCustomers can take full advantage of the new features and resolved issues throughout all releases.\n\nDownload and description of Gemini 330 series firmware\n\nGet the firmware changelog ：[Firmware changelog](https://orbbec-debian-repos-aws.s3.amazonaws.com/product/Firmware_changelog.pdf)\n\n**Firmware**\n\n**Release**\n\n**Release Date**\n\n**FW Version**\n\n**SDK Version**\n\n**Supported Pruduct**\n\n**Comment**\n\n**Release Method**\n\n[Gemini330\\_Release\\_1.8.17](https://orbbec-debian-repos-aws.s3.amazonaws.com/product/Gemini330_Release_v1.8.17.zip)\n\nRelease\\_1.8.17\n\n05-Aug-26\n\n1.8.17\n\n[2.9.3](https://github.com/orbbec/OrbbecSDK_v2/releases/tag/v2.9.3)\n\nGemini 338Le/338Lg\n\nNew FW release\n\nonline update & production configuration\n\n[Gemini330\\_Release\\_1.8.10](https://orbbec-debian-repos-aws.s3.amazonaws.com/product/Gemini330_Release_1.8.10.zip)\n\nRelease\\_1.8.10\n\n26-Jun-26\n\n1.8.10\n\n[2.8.7](https://github.com/orbbec/OrbbecSDK_v2/releases/tag/v2.8.7)\n\nGemini 335/336/330\n\nGemini 335L/336L/330L\n\nGemini 335Lg\n\nGemini 335Le\n\nNew FW & SDK release\n\nonline update & production configuration\n\n[Gemini330\\_Release\\_1.6.00](https://orbbec-debian-repos-aws.s3.amazonaws.com/product/Gemini330_Release_1.6.00.zip)\n\nRelease\\_1.6.00\n\n13-Oct-25\n\n1.6.00\n\n[2.5.5](https://github.com/orbbec/OrbbecSDK_v2/releases/tag/v2.5.5)\n\nGemini 335/336/330\n\nGemini 335L/336L/330L\n\nGemini 335Lg\n\nGemini 335Le\n\nNew FW & SDK release\n\nonline update & production configuration\n\n[Gemini330\\_Release\\_1.5.5